									<h3 class="post-title detail_title_1">Yassıada oteli ihalesine 2 şirket katıldı</h3>
									<p>
																			</p>
								</div><!--blog-info end-->
								<div class="blog-img">
									<img src="https://www.turizmgazetesi.com/images/show/news/9973da740665fce103519c15a86efc11.jpeg" alt="" style="width: 100% !important;">
